.TH GLOW-KIT-GUI 1 "July 2026" "Fedora Glow Kit 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
glow-kit-gui \- open the Fedora Glow Kit control deck and optional tray
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B glow-kit-gui
.RI [ --tray ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B glow-kit-gui
previews Fedora Glow Kit profiles, target desktops, update commands, and
recovery actions.
Mutating actions open the
.BR glow-kit (1)
command-line interface in a visible terminal.
The graphical process does not request privileges.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --tray
Start with the system-tray integration enabled.
Tray startup remains opt-in and can be disabled in settings.
.SH PRIVACY
The application is local-only.
It does not collect telemetry, usernames, hostnames, serial numbers, network
addresses, or device inventories.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glow-kit (1)
